# BACKEND ARCHITECTURE RULE — ASP.NET Core Clean Architecture

> **Mục đích**: File rule này mô tả kiến trúc, cấu hình, patterns, và coding conventions cho dự án Backend sử dụng ASP.NET Core Web API + Clean Architecture. Áp dụng được cho BẤT KỲ project nào dùng cùng tech stack.

---

## 1. TECH STACK

| Mục | Công nghệ | Phiên bản |
|---|---|---|
| **Framework** | ASP.NET Core Web API (C#) | .NET 9.0 |
| **Database** | PostgreSQL | — |
| **ORM** | Entity Framework Core + Npgsql | 9.0.0 |
| **Authentication** | JWT Bearer Token (Access + Refresh Token) | 9.0.0 |
| **Realtime** | SignalR | Built-in |
| **API Documentation** | Swagger (Swashbuckle) | 6.6.2 |
| **Payment Gateway** | PayOS | 2.1.0 |
| **Image Storage** | Cloudinary (CloudinaryDotNet) | 1.29.1 |
| **Email** | Gmail SMTP (System.Net.Mail hoặc tương đương) | — |
| **AI Chat** | OpenRouter API (Google Gemini) | — |
| **OCR / Computer Vision** | YOLO ONNX + PaddleOCR + OpenCvSharp | — |
| **Password Hashing** | BCrypt.Net-Next | 4.2.0 |
| **QR Code** | QRCoder | 1.8.0 |
| **Google OAuth** | Google.Apis.Auth | 1.74.0 |

---

## 2. KIẾN TRÚC CLEAN ARCHITECTURE (4 LAYERS)

### 2.1 Cấu trúc Solution

```
<SolutionName>.sln
├── <ProjectName>.Domain          ← Entities, Enums, Repository Interfaces (KHÔNG có NuGet ngoài)
├── <ProjectName>.Application     ← Service Interfaces, DTOs, Application Services (pure logic)
├── <ProjectName>.Infrastructure  ← DbContext, Repositories impl, External Services impl
└── <ProjectName>.API             ← Controllers, SignalR Hubs, Program.cs (DI + Middleware)
```

### 2.2 Dependency Flow (TUÂN THỦ CHẶT CHẼ)

```
API ──────→ Application
API ──────→ Infrastructure
Infrastructure → Domain
Infrastructure → Application
Application ──→ Domain
Domain ────→ (KHÔNG phụ thuộc ai)
```

> **Quy tắc vàng**:
> - `Domain` KHÔNG reference bất kỳ layer nào khác.
> - `Application` chỉ reference `Domain`.
> - `Infrastructure` reference `Domain` + `Application` (để implement interface).
> - `API` reference `Application` + `Infrastructure` (để đăng ký DI).

### 2.3 NuGet Packages theo Layer

#### Domain (Không có NuGet ngoài — Pure C#)
```xml
<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">
  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFramework>net9.0</TargetFramework>
    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
  </PropertyGroup>
</Project>
```

#### Application
```xml
<PackageReference Include="BCrypt.Net-Next" Version="4.2.0" />
<PackageReference Include="Google.Apis.Auth" Version="1.74.0" />
<PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.Configuration.Abstractions" Version="10.0.8" />
<PackageReference Include="Microsoft.IdentityModel.Tokens" Version="8.18.0" />
<PackageReference Include="System.IdentityModel.Tokens.Jwt" Version="8.18.0" />
<PackageReference Include="QRCoder" Version="1.8.0" />
<!-- Reference: Domain -->
```

#### Infrastructure
```xml
<PackageReference Include="Npgsql.EntityFrameworkCore.PostgreSQL" Version="9.0.0" />
<PackageReference Include="Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore.Design" Version="9.0.0" />
<PackageReference Include="CloudinaryDotNet" Version="1.29.1" />
<PackageReference Include="payOS" Version="2.1.0" />
<PackageReference Include="Microsoft.ML.OnnxRuntime" Version="1.19.2" />
<PackageReference Include="Sdcb.PaddleOCR" Version="3.0.1" />
<PackageReference Include="Sdcb.PaddleOCR.Models.Local" Version="3.0.1" />
<PackageReference Include="OpenCvSharp4.runtime.win" Version="4.13.0.20260302" />
<PackageReference Include="SixLabors.ImageSharp" Version="3.1.4" />
<PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.Hosting.Abstractions" Version="10.0.8" />
<!-- Reference: Domain, Application -->
```

#### API
```xml
<PackageReference Include="Microsoft.AspNetCore.OpenApi" Version="9.0.11" />
<PackageReference Include="Microsoft.AspNetCore.Authentication.JwtBearer" Version="9.0.0" />
<PackageReference Include="Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore.Design" Version="9.0.0" />
<PackageReference Include="Swashbuckle.AspNetCore" Version="6.6.2" />
<!-- Reference: Application, Infrastructure -->
```

