## 6. API LAYER — PATTERNS

### 6.1 Controller Convention

```csharp
namespace <ProjectName>.API.Controllers;

[ApiController]
[Route("api/[controller]")]
public class ExamplesController : ControllerBase
{
    private readonly IExampleService _service;
    
    public ExamplesController(IExampleService service) => _service = service;
    
    [HttpGet]
    [Authorize(Roles = "Admin,Manager")]
    public async Task<IActionResult> GetAll()
    {
        try
        {
            var result = await _service.GetAllAsync();
            return Ok(result);
        }
        catch (Exception ex)
        {
            return StatusCode(500, new { message = ex.Message });
        }
    }
    
    [HttpGet("{id}")]
    public async Task<IActionResult> GetById(Guid id) { ... }
    
    [HttpPost]
    [Authorize(Roles = "Admin")]
    public async Task<IActionResult> Create([FromBody] CreateExampleDto dto) { ... }
    
    [HttpPut("{id}")]
    public async Task<IActionResult> Update(Guid id, [FromBody] UpdateExampleDto dto) { ... }
    
    [HttpDelete("{id}")]
    public async Task<IActionResult> Delete(Guid id) { ... }
}
```

**Quy tắc**:
- Tên Controller: số nhiều (`ExamplesController`, không phải `ExampleController`)
- Route: `api/[controller]` (tự động lấy tên controller bỏ hậu tố)
- Mọi action PHẢI `async Task<IActionResult>`
- Dùng `[Authorize(Roles = "...")]` để phân quyền
- Try-catch mọi action, trả về lỗi rõ ràng

### 6.2 SignalR Hub Convention

```csharp
namespace <ProjectName>.API.Hubs;

[Authorize]
public class ExampleHub : Hub
{
    public override async Task OnConnectedAsync()
    {
        var userId = Context.User?.FindFirst(ClaimTypes.NameIdentifier)?.Value;
        if (userId != null)
            await Groups.AddToGroupAsync(Context.ConnectionId, $"user-{userId}");
        await base.OnConnectedAsync();
    }
}
```

### 6.3 Realtime Service (Wrapper cho SignalR)

```csharp
// Application/Interfaces/
public interface IRealtimeService
{
    Task NotifyUserAsync(Guid userId, string eventName, object data);
    Task BroadcastAsync(string eventName, object data);
}

// API/Services/
public class RealtimeService : IRealtimeService
{
    private readonly IHubContext<ExampleHub> _hub;
    
    public RealtimeService(IHubContext<ExampleHub> hub) => _hub = hub;
    
    public async Task NotifyUserAsync(Guid userId, string eventName, object data)
        => await _hub.Clients.Group($"user-{userId}").SendAsync(eventName, data);
        
    public async Task BroadcastAsync(string eventName, object data)
        => await _hub.Clients.All.SendAsync(eventName, data);
}
```

