### 7.2 .env File (Override khi deploy)

Dùng cú pháp `Section__Key` để override `appsettings.json`:
```env
ConnectionStrings__DefaultConnection=Host=...;Database=...
JwtSettings__Key=...
PayOS__ClientId=...
Cloudinary__CloudName=...
EmailSettings__SenderPassword=...
OpenRouter__ApiKey=...
```

